@*
    ── ניהול (Management hub) ───────────────────────────────────────────────
    Route:  /management  (+ /management/admin) — the "ניהול" nav item in the
            Lecturer / Admin shell. THE management landing page; there is no
            second one.

    Visual reference:
        design/design-system/Motiva Admin Home.dc.html

    OVERVIEW STATE
    ──────────────
    The hub. Four named sections, each a grid of destination tiles, rendered
    from ManagementHubDefinitions — TEN management modules at their existing
    routes. Adding a management area is a record in that file.

    CURATED, NOT EXHAUSTIVE. The hub used to carry all twenty-one destinations
    the pre-Motiva page had. Eleven were withdrawn — consolidated into the
    screen that owns the concept, already reachable from the primary nav, or an
    operational queue rather than configuration. ManagementHubDefinitions
    .WithdrawnFromHub names every one and why. Nothing was deleted: every route
    resolves, every page renders and every [Authorize] is unchanged.

    CATEGORY DETAIL STATES — CURRENTLY UNREACHABLE, DELIBERATELY KEPT
    ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
    Four quick-edit panels render on this page rather than at a route of their
    own, and a tile carrying their SectionKey was their only entry point. All
    four tiles were withdrawn (each duplicates a screen that owns the concept),
    so the panels below no longer open.

    They are kept, not deleted — the same treatment Management.razor and
    ManagementCardsGrid already have in this folder. The panel markup, its CSS,
    the _activeSection machinery and LoadAllAsync are intact and correct, so
    re-showing one is a single ManagementEntry moved back into Sections.
    1. teams      — mentor assignment per team
    2. milestones — milestone open/due/close dates
    3. resources  — per-resource project-type visibility
    4. settings   — the Student/Mentor feature-flag rows

    SHELL
    ─────
    Same title-row pattern as the other finished Management screens
    (38 px / 700 / −0.035 em, with the descriptive line on its baseline).
    No MPageHeader gradient — the canvas shell already draws the page's ground.
*@

@page "/management"
@* Compatibility: /management/admin was a second, competing hub with the same
   13 modules. It now resolves to this one Management experience so the two
   cannot drift apart. Existing links and bookmarks keep working. *@
@page "/management/admin"
@layout AppLayout
@attribute [Authorize(Roles = Roles.Admin + "," + Roles.Staff)]
@namespace AuthWithAdmin.Client.Pages.Management
@using Microsoft.AspNetCore.Authorization
@using AuthWithAdmin.Client.Components
@using AuthWithAdmin.Client.Services
@using AuthWithAdmin.Shared.AuthSharedModels
@using Microsoft.AspNetCore.Components.Authorization

@inject IDashboardOverviewService        DashboardService
@inject IMilestoneManagementService      MilestoneService
@inject IResourceFilesService            ResourceFilesService
@inject IRoleSettingsManagementService   RoleSettingsService
@inject IProjectMentorsService           MentorsService
@inject AuthenticationStateProvider      AuthState

<div class="lmg-page" dir="rtl">

    <!-- ══ Title row ══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════ -->
    <div class="lmg-title-row">
        <div class="lmg-title-block">
            @if (_activeSection is not null)
            {
                <button type="button" class="lmg-back" @onclick="GoBack">
                    <svg width="13" height="13" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor"
                         stroke-width="2.4" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true">
                        <path d="m9 18 6-6-6-6"></path>
                    </svg>
                    חזרה לניהול
                </button>
            }
            @*  Title and its line share ONE baseline, which is the composition
                the reference draws and the one every other finished Admin
                screen already uses (FormsManagement's .fml-head-title,
                UsersManagement's). The overview's line is no longer suppressed:
                the reference gives the hub a sentence saying what the page is,
                and with the five section heads now sitting inside their own
                grids rather than on top of six cards, it costs no vertical
                space that the first card wanted. *@
            <div class="lmg-title-line">
                <h1 class="lmg-h1">ניהול</h1>
                <p class="lmg-subtitle">@PageSubtitle</p>
            </div>
        </div>

    </div>

    @*  THE HUB DOES NOT WAIT FOR DATA. It is a static map of ten destinations,
        and gating it on LoadAllAsync made every visit to ניהול open on a
        spinner while four requests the grid does not need came back. Only the
        in-place panels below read those results, so only they wait.

        One annotation on one tile (the milestone-template count) does come from
        the fetch; it appears when it arrives rather than holding the page. *@
    @if (_activeSection is null)
    {
        <!-- ══ Overview — the management hub ════════════════════════════════ -->
        @*  Structure and visual language: design/design-system/Motiva Admin
            Home.dc.html — named sections, each a grid of one-line destination
            tiles, on the page's own canvas rather than inside a section card.

            WHAT REPLACED WHAT. The previous overview was six MCards laid into
            two independently-balanced columns, each holding a head glyph and a
            run of borderless module rows. It read as six lists rather than as a
            map of the system: every module looked identical, the two columns
            put unrelated areas side by side at the same eye level, and the
            column split was computed by an exhaustive search over 64 layouts
            that existed only to keep the two stacks the same height.

            The reference's answer is simpler and says more: the SECTION is a
            heading on the canvas, and the tile is the bounded object. Sections
            run full width in reading order, so nothing has to be balanced and
            nothing competes across a gutter, and every tile carries its own
            icon, count and description — which is what makes twenty-one
            destinations scannable instead of dense.

            WHAT THE HUB SHOWS is ManagementHubDefinitions' business, not this
            file's — ten curated destinations in the reference's four sections,
            with the eleven withdrawn ones and their reasons recorded beside
            them. Adding or restoring a management area is one record there and
            no change here. *@
        <div class="lmg-sections">
            @* `sec`, not `section`: "@section" is a reserved Razor
               directive, so a loop variable by that name stops being an
               expression the moment it is used in an attribute. *@
            @foreach (var sec in VisibleSections())
            {
                <section class="lmg-sec" aria-labelledby="@sec.Id">
                    <div class="lmg-sec-head">
                        <h2 class="lmg-sec-title" id="@sec.Id">@sec.Title</h2>
                        <p class="lmg-sec-note">@sec.Note</p>
                    </div>

                    <div class="lmg-sec-grid">
                        @foreach (var entry in sec.Entries)
                        {
                            var e = entry;
                            <MManagementTile Title="@e.Title"
                                             Description="@e.Description"
                                             IconMarkup="@e.IconMarkup"
                                             Accent="@e.Accent"
                                             Href="@e.Route"
                                             Count="@CountFor(e)"
                                             OnClick="@(() => ActivateEntry(e))" />
                        }
                    </div>
                </section>
            }
        </div>
    }
    else if (_loading)
    {
        @*  A PANEL is what waits, not the page. Reached only when a tile
            carrying a SectionKey is on the hub — none is today, so this
            branch is currently unreachable and is kept with the panels it
            belongs to. *@
        <div class="lmg-loading" role="status" aria-live="polite">
            <span class="lmg-spinner" aria-hidden="true"></span>
            <span>טוענת נתוני ניהול…</span>
        </div>
    }
    else
    {
        <!-- ══ צוותים ושיוכים ════════════════════════════════════════════════ -->
        @if (_activeSection == "teams")
        {
            <section class="lmg-panel" aria-labelledby="lmg-teams-title">
                <div class="lmg-panel-head">
                    <h2 class="lmg-panel-title" id="lmg-teams-title">צוותים ושיוכים</h2>
                    <span class="motiva-tag lmg-head-tag">@_projects.Count צוותים</span>
                    <span class="lmg-head-note">שינוי שיוך מנחה לפרויקט</span>
                </div>

                @if (_projects.Count == 0)
                {
                    <p class="lmg-empty-msg">אין פרויקטים פעילים כרגע.</p>
                }
                else
                {
                    <div class="lmg-acc-list">
                        @foreach (var proj in _projects)
                        {
                            var p = proj;
                            bool isEditing = _editingProjectId == p.ProjectId;
                            // Hoisted: an interpolated string inside a double-quoted
                            // Razor attribute ends the attribute at its own quote.
                            var teamName = p.TeamName ?? p.ProjectTitle;
                            var teamSub  = $"פרויקט {p.ProjectNumber} · {p.ProjectTitle}";
                            var teamAria = $"שיוך מנחים — {teamName}";
                            <MAccordionItem Open="@isEditing"
                                            OnToggle="@(() => ToggleEditTeam(p.ProjectId))"
                                            Primary="@teamName"
                                            Secondary="@teamSub"
                                            AriaLabel="@teamAria">
                                <Leading>
                                    <span class="lmg-dot" style="background:@HealthDot(p.HealthBucket)" aria-hidden="true"></span>
                                </Leading>
                                <MetaContent>
                                    @if (!string.IsNullOrWhiteSpace(p.MentorNames))
                                    {
                                        <span class="lmg-avatar" aria-hidden="true">@TwoInitials(p.MentorNames)</span>
                                    }
                                    <span class="lmg-mentor-name">@(p.MentorNames ?? "ללא מנחה")</span>
                                </MetaContent>
                                <ChildContent>
                                    <div class="lmg-expand-inner lmg-expand-teams">
                                        @if (_editLoading)
                                        {
                                            <span class="lmg-edit-loading" role="status">טוענת מנחים…</span>
                                        }
                                        else
                                        {
                                            <!-- Current mentors -->
                                            @if (_editCurrentMentors.Count > 0)
                                            {
                                                <div class="lmg-mentor-current">
                                                    <span class="lmg-expand-label">מנחים נוכחיים</span>
                                                    <div class="lmg-chips-row">
                                                        @foreach (var m in _editCurrentMentors)
                                                        {
                                                            var mentor = m;
                                                            <span class="lmg-mentor-chip">
                                                                <span class="lmg-chip-avatar" aria-hidden="true">@TwoInitials(mentor.FullName)</span>
                                                                @mentor.FullName
                                                                <button type="button"
                                                                        class="lmg-chip-remove"
                                                                        @onclick="() => RemoveMentorAsync(p.ProjectId, mentor.UserId)"
                                                                        aria-label="הסרת @mentor.FullName">
                                                                    <svg width="9" height="9" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round" aria-hidden="true">
                                                                        <path d="M18 6 6 18M6 6l12 12"></path>
                                                                    </svg>
                                                                </button>
                                                            </span>
                                                        }
                                                    </div>
                                                </div>
                                            }

                                            <!-- Candidate list -->
                                            <div class="lmg-mentor-add">
                                                <span class="lmg-expand-label">הוספת מנחה</span>
                                                @if (_editCandidates.Count == 0)
                                                {
                                                    <span class="lmg-expand-empty">אין מנחים זמינים להוספה.</span>
                                                }
                                                else
                                                {
                                                    <div class="lmg-candidates">
                                                        @foreach (var cand in _editCandidates)
                                                        {
                                                            var cd = cand;
                                                            <button type="button"
                                                                    class="lmg-candidate"
                                                                    @onclick="() => AddMentorAsync(p.ProjectId, cd.UserId)">
                                                                <span class="lmg-cand-avatar" aria-hidden="true">@TwoInitials(cd.FullName)</span>
                                                                <span class="lmg-cand-name">@cd.FullName</span>
                                                                <span class="lmg-cand-role">@cd.Roles</span>
                                                                <svg width="12" height="12" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lmg-cand-plus" aria-hidden="true">
                                                                    <path d="M12 5v14M5 12h14"></path>
                                                                </svg>
                                                            </button>
                                                        }
                                                    </div>
                                                }
                                            </div>
                                        }
                                    </div>
                                </ChildContent>
                            </MAccordionItem>
                        }
                    </div>
                }
            </section>
        }

        <!-- ══ אבני דרך ומועדים ══════════════════════════════════════════════ -->
        @if (_activeSection == "milestones")
        {
            <section class="lmg-panel" aria-labelledby="lmg-ms-title">
                <div class="lmg-panel-head">
                    <h2 class="lmg-panel-title" id="lmg-ms-title">אבני דרך ומועדים</h2>
                    <span class="motiva-tag lmg-head-tag">@_milestones.Count אבני דרך</span>
                    <span class="lmg-head-note">שינוי תאריך מעדכן את לוח השנה ואת ההתראות</span>
                </div>

                @if (_milestones.Count == 0)
                {
                    <p class="lmg-empty-msg">אין תבניות אבני דרך מוגדרות.</p>
                }
                else
                {
                    <div class="lmg-acc-list">
                        @foreach (var ms in _milestones.OrderBy(m => m.OrderIndex))
                        {
                            var m = ms;
                            bool isEditing = _editingMilestoneId == m.Id;
                            var status = MilestoneStatus(m);
                            var msAria = $"עריכת מועדים — {m.Title}";
                            <MAccordionItem Open="@isEditing"
                                            OnToggle="@(() => ToggleEditMilestone(m))"
                                            Primary="@m.Title"
                                            Secondary="@m.Applicability"
                                            AriaLabel="@msAria">
                                <Leading>
                                    <span class="lmg-ms-index" aria-hidden="true">@m.OrderIndex</span>
                                </Leading>
                                <MetaContent>
                                    <span class="lmg-date-range">@DateRange(m)</span>
                                </MetaContent>
                                <Status>
                                    <span class="lmg-status-pill lmg-s-@status.Key">@status.Label</span>
                                </Status>
                                <ChildContent>
                                    <div class="lmg-expand-inner lmg-expand-ms">
                                        <div class="lmg-date-fields">
                                            <label class="lmg-date-field">
                                                <span class="lmg-field-label">פתיחה</span>
                                                <input type="date" class="lmg-date-input"
                                                       value="@_editOpenDate"
                                                       @onchange="e => _editOpenDate = e.Value?.ToString() ?? _editOpenDate" />
                                            </label>
                                            <label class="lmg-date-field">
                                                <span class="lmg-field-label">מועד הגשה</span>
                                                <input type="date" class="lmg-date-input"
                                                       value="@_editDueDate"
                                                       @onchange="e => _editDueDate = e.Value?.ToString() ?? _editDueDate" />
                                            </label>
                                            <label class="lmg-date-field">
                                                <span class="lmg-field-label">סגירה</span>
                                                <input type="date" class="lmg-date-input"
                                                       value="@_editCloseDate"
                                                       @onchange="e => _editCloseDate = e.Value?.ToString() ?? _editCloseDate" />
                                            </label>
                                        </div>
                                        <div class="lmg-expand-actions">
                                            <button type="button"
                                                    class="lmg-save-btn motiva-cta"
                                                    disabled="@_msSaving"
                                                    @onclick="() => SaveMilestoneDatesAsync(m)">
                                                @(_msSaving ? "שומר…" : "שמירה")
                                            </button>
                                            @if (!string.IsNullOrWhiteSpace(_msError))
                                            {
                                                <span class="lmg-error-msg" role="alert">@_msError</span>
                                            }
                                        </div>
                                    </div>
                                </ChildContent>
                            </MAccordionItem>
                        }
                    </div>
                }
            </section>
        }

        <!-- ══ ניהול משאבים ══════════════════════════════════════════════════ -->
        @if (_activeSection == "resources")
        {
            <section class="lmg-panel" aria-labelledby="lmg-res-title">
                <div class="lmg-panel-head">
                    <h2 class="lmg-panel-title" id="lmg-res-title">ניהול משאבים</h2>
                    <span class="motiva-tag lmg-head-tag">@_resources.Count קבצים</span>
                    <a class="lmg-add-link" href="/management/resources">
                        <svg width="12" height="12" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor"
                             stroke-width="2.4" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true">
                            <path d="M12 5v14M5 12h14"></path>
                        </svg>
                        הוספת משאב
                    </a>
                </div>

                @if (_resources.Count == 0)
                {
                    <p class="lmg-empty-msg">
                        אין משאבים בספרייה.
                        <a href="/management/resources" class="lmg-empty-link">הוספה ראשונה ↗</a>
                    </p>
                }
                else
                {
                    <div class="lmg-res-header" aria-hidden="true">
                        <span class="lmg-res-col-main">שם המשאב</span>
                        <span class="lmg-res-col-toggle">טכנולוגי</span>
                        <span class="lmg-res-col-toggle">מתודולוגי</span>
                    </div>
                    <div class="lmg-rows" role="list">
                        @foreach (var res in _resources)
                        {
                            var r = res;
                            <div class="lmg-row lmg-res-row" role="listitem">
                                <span class="lmg-res-icon" aria-hidden="true">
                                    @((MarkupString)ResourceIcon(r))
                                </span>
                                <div class="lmg-row-text">
                                    <span class="lmg-row-name">@FileTitle(r.FileName)</span>
                                    <span class="lmg-row-sub">@ResourceTypeLabel(r)</span>
                                </div>
                                <div class="lmg-toggle-cell">
                                    <button type="button"
                                            role="switch"
                                            aria-checked="@r.ForTechnological.ToString().ToLowerInvariant()"
                                            class="lmg-toggle @(r.ForTechnological ? "lmg-toggle-on" : "")"
                                            @onclick="() => ToggleResAsync(r, tech: true)">
                                        <span class="lmg-toggle-thumb"></span>
                                    </button>
                                </div>
                                <div class="lmg-toggle-cell">
                                    <button type="button"
                                            role="switch"
                                            aria-checked="@r.ForMethodological.ToString().ToLowerInvariant()"
                                            class="lmg-toggle @(r.ForMethodological ? "lmg-toggle-on" : "")"
                                            @onclick="() => ToggleResAsync(r, tech: false)">
                                        <span class="lmg-toggle-thumb"></span>
                                    </button>
                                </div>
                            </div>
                        }
                    </div>
                }
            </section>
        }

        <!-- ══ הרשאות והגדרות ════════════════════════════════════════════════ -->
        @if (_activeSection == "settings")
        {
            <section class="lmg-panel" aria-labelledby="lmg-set-title">
                <div class="lmg-panel-head">
                    <h2 class="lmg-panel-title" id="lmg-set-title">הרשאות והגדרות</h2>
                    <span class="lmg-head-note">שינויים נכנסים לתוקף מיידית</span>
                </div>

                @if (_roleSettings.Count == 0)
                {
                    <p class="lmg-empty-msg">לא נמצאו הגדרות הרשאות.</p>
                }
                else
                {
                    @foreach (var role in _roleSettings)
                    {
                        var rs = role;
                        <div class="lmg-settings-group">
                            <div class="lmg-settings-group-label">@RoleDisplayName(rs.RoleName)</div>
                            @foreach (var flag in SettingFlags)
                            {
                                var f = flag;
                                bool isOn = GetFlag(rs, f);
                                <div class="lmg-setting-row">
                                    <div class="lmg-setting-text">
                                        <span class="lmg-setting-name">@RoleFeatures.Label(f)</span>
                                        <span class="lmg-setting-desc">@SettingDescription(f)</span>
                                    </div>
                                    <button type="button"
                                            role="switch"
                                            aria-checked="@isOn.ToString().ToLowerInvariant()"
                                            class="lmg-toggle @(isOn ? "lmg-toggle-on" : "")"
                                            @onclick="() => ToggleSettingAsync(rs, f)">
                                        <span class="lmg-toggle-thumb"></span>
                                    </button>
                                </div>
                            }
                        </div>
                    }
                }
            </section>
        }
    }

</div>

@code {
    // ── State ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
    private bool    _loading       = true;
    private string? _activeSection;           // null = overview

    // Teams
    private List<DashboardProjectRowDto> _projects           = new();
    private int?                         _editingProjectId;
    private bool                         _editLoading;
    private List<ProjectMentorDto>       _editCurrentMentors = new();
    private List<MentorCandidateDto>     _editCandidates     = new();

    // Milestones
    private List<MilestoneTemplateDto>   _milestones         = new();
    private int?                         _editingMilestoneId;
    private string                       _editOpenDate       = "";
    private string                       _editDueDate        = "";
    private string                       _editCloseDate      = "";
    private bool                         _msSaving;
    private string                       _msError            = "";

    // Resources
    private List<ResourceFileDto>        _resources          = new();

    // Settings
    private List<RoleSettingsDto>        _roleSettings       = new();

    // Module visibility (UI only — see the note above VisibleSections)
    private List<RoleSettingsDto>        _allRoleSettings    = new();
    private bool                         _isCourseStaff;

    // ── Constant flag list for the settings section ────────────────────────
    private static readonly string[] SettingFlags =
    {
        RoleFeatures.CanOpenRequests,
        RoleFeatures.CanViewTasks,
        RoleFeatures.CanSubmitTasks,
        RoleFeatures.CanManageAssignments,
        RoleFeatures.CanManageMilestones,
    };

    // ── Lifecycle ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
    protected override async Task OnInitializedAsync() => await LoadAllAsync();

    private async Task LoadAllAsync()
    {
        _loading = true;

        var tDash     = DashboardService.GetAsync("lecturer");
        var tMs       = MilestoneService.GetTemplatesAsync();
        var tRes      = ResourceFilesService.GetAllAsync();
        var tSettings = RoleSettingsService.GetAllAsync();

        await Task.WhenAll(tDash, tMs, tRes, tSettings);

        _projects     = tDash.Result?.Projects ?? new();
        _milestones   = tMs.Result             ?? new();
        _resources    = tRes.Result            ?? new();
        // The settings SECTION still shows only Student/Mentor, exactly as before.
        // The unfiltered rows are kept separately because module visibility reads
        // the Admin / Staff rows — see CanSee().
        _allRoleSettings = tSettings.Result ?? new();
        _roleSettings = _allRoleSettings
            .Where(r => r.RoleName is "Student" or "Mentor")
            .OrderBy(r => r.RoleName == "Student" ? 0 : 1)
            .ToList();

        var auth = await AuthState.GetAuthenticationStateAsync();
        _isCourseStaff = auth.User.IsInRole(Roles.Staff);

        _loading = false;
    }

    // ── The hub (the overview) ─────────────────────────────────────────────
    //
    // THE LIST ITSELF IS NOT HERE. Sections, tiles, routes, icons and flags all
    // live in ManagementHubDefinitions — see that file for why. What is left on
    // the page is the three things the definitions cannot know: which tiles the
    // viewer's role may see, which tiles have a live figure to print, and what
    // happens when one is pressed.
    //
    // VISIBILITY IS UI / IA ONLY.
    // Server authorization is deliberately untouched here and is BROADER than
    // what this list shows: AuthRepository.CreateToken issues an Admin role
    // claim to every Staff user (the Staff => Admin invariant, also enforced by
    // triggers in DatabaseMigrator), so every module remains reachable by URL
    // for course staff. Hiding a tile is an information-architecture decision,
    // NOT a security boundary. Enforcing these flags server-side is a separate
    // permissions-hardening task.
    //
    // The flag VALUES are not invented here — they are the seeded RoleSettings
    // rows (Admin: CanManageUsers=1, CanManageAirtable=1; Staff: both 0). If an
    // administrator flips Staff's flag on the "הרשאות לפי תפקיד" screen, the
    // tile appears. Nothing about Admin-vs-Staff is hardcoded.

    /// <summary>The hub's sections with the tiles this viewer's role may see,
    /// dropping any section that ends up empty.</summary>
    private IEnumerable<ManagementHubDefinitions.ManagementSection> VisibleSections() =>
        ManagementHubDefinitions.Sections
            .Select(s => s with { Entries = s.Entries.Where(e => CanSee(e.RequiresFlag)).ToArray() })
            .Where(s => s.Entries.Length > 0);

    /// <summary>The live figure printed beside a tile's title, or null for the
    /// tiles that have none.
    ///
    /// <para>REAL DATA ONLY, and only where the page already fetched it. The
    /// reference prints a count on several of its cards; exactly one of the ten
    /// the hub now shows has a value this page already holds, and the rest would
    /// need a request per tile to answer. A hub that renders a plausible-looking
    /// number it did not measure is worse than one that renders nothing, so the
    /// other nine print nothing.</para>
    ///
    /// <para>Keyed on Route since the curation pass, because the three counts
    /// that used to live here belonged to the in-place panels and those are no
    /// longer shown. It arrives after the first render — the hub is static data
    /// and does not wait for it.</para></summary>
    private string? CountFor(ManagementHubDefinitions.ManagementEntry entry) => entry.Route switch
    {
        "/management/milestones" when _milestones.Count > 0 => $"{_milestones.Count} אבני דרך",
        _                                                    => null,
    };

    /// <summary>Pressing a tile. Only the in-place panels reach this — a tile
    /// with a route is a real anchor and the browser navigates it, which is the
    /// whole reason the two render as different elements.</summary>
    private void ActivateEntry(ManagementHubDefinitions.ManagementEntry entry)
    {
        if (entry.SectionKey is not null) OpenSection(entry.SectionKey);
    }
    /// <summary>UI visibility only — see the note above VisibleSections.
    ///
    /// <para>Reads the seeded flag of the role the viewer actually holds.
    /// "GET api/role-settings/me" cannot be used for this: it aggregates with
    /// MAX() over the caller's UserRoles rows, and the Staff => Admin trigger
    /// writes an Admin row for every Staff user — so its union always reports
    /// Admin's flags and would make this check a no-op.</para>
    ///
    /// <para>Fails OPEN when the rows are unavailable: the server permits the
    /// module regardless, so hiding it on a transient fetch error would remove a
    /// capability the user genuinely has.</para></summary>
    private bool CanSee(string? flag)
    {
        if (string.IsNullOrWhiteSpace(flag)) return true;

        var roleName = _isCourseStaff ? Roles.Staff : Roles.Admin;
        var row = _allRoleSettings.FirstOrDefault(
            r => string.Equals(r.RoleName, roleName, StringComparison.OrdinalIgnoreCase));

        return row is null || GetFlag(row, flag);
    }

